Looking at the code in `patches.ts` at lines 240-250:

```typescript
case ADD:
    switch (type) {
        case Archtype.Array:
            return base.splice(key as any, 0, value)
        ...
    }
```

The fix should check if `key === "-"` and if so, use `base.length` as the index:

```typescript
case ADD:
    switch (type) {
        case Archtype.Array:
            // "-" per RFC 6902 indicates appending to end of array
            const index = key === "-" ? base.length : key
            return base.splice(index as any, 0, value)
        ...
    }
```

